{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 976,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c29c949d3ac7d44d20dcb88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果习得所需的表现分数不足，可以进行<color=#ff9900>预约</color>。\\n预约后，将在育成及训练界面上方\\n显示习得<color=#ff9900>所需的剩余表现分数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16bcbdc093f99e0aaa3a5ec433f02facef7f2730302925080a2c1b41b227821",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4303585edef7801294a1429",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "习得乐曲后<color=#ff9900>Live期待度</color>将会上升，\\n量表达到最大值时Live就会获得<color=#ff9900>大成功</color>。\\nLive期待度会在每次举办后重置，\\n为各场Live而去学习新歌曲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa9ecdf1ba4bd6f58bb58a1673ed4d8186fffa44b059963d9dbcb6602028356",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26112eff2bea104ba834483d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成赛马娘的碎片可以转换为<color=#ff9900>四叶草</color>。\\n四叶草很珍贵，可在商店兑换其他物品。\\n碎片可以解锁育成赛马娘，也可以用于才能开花\\n转换的时候请一定要注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1b80efa64073f2a828abe346a46c423b6ee1693a8d9abc1baaa6f64d5f7b2c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a2c98c9828271cca9a978d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>Live</color>上，将<color=#ff9900>发表习得的乐曲</color>。\\n如果发表的新学会的乐曲达到一定数量，Live就能<color=#ff9900>获得大成功</color>。\\n以习得乐曲后提高的Live期待度为参考，\\n朝着大成功努力吧！\\nLive获得大成功的话，<color=#ff9900>赛马娘就能够得到充分成长</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a972848a77e3b6b409beb871525f1344596eabc4c80d964ae66d7905707eb680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f563ba808ca91516b8b5c23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在习得新乐曲的状态下结束Live后，\\n<color=#ff9900>Live加成</color>将会自下一回合起生效。\\n同种类型的Live加成，<color=#ff9900>效果将会加算</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "166ae4ae159eb5958fc3845ba98f29a9f603fbba0a99ea6acb7edeffe945ff52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a820b51e1e7845d6cab63463",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所谓<color=#ff9901>特別移籍 StarHorse4 Edition</color>就是将已经进入殿堂的\\n赛马娘移籍至其他队伍中，并获取相应的礼物。\\n不过，送到其他队伍中的赛马娘无法再次寻回，\\n请千万小心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4289f2114dd62b0bd753f0e71ecb520099cb98745fda2b66da35af04277e2e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a723c75fc5a0d7d0a12ea7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每个前来募集移籍赛马娘的训练员都有不同的<color=#ff9901>期待度</color>，\\n移籍赛马娘所能获得的礼物也会随期待度不同而变化。\\n<color=#ff9901>那个训练员</color>会给出<color=#ff9901>期待度4</color>的募集请求吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa60c2a7b126251807484af87e40fefcb58ffb39074738690cfa899e0777c0c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8a1b40bef7be0b329d98c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是满足期待度3的募集要求，\\n便能获得对应的<color=#ff9901>被移籍赛马娘的碎片</color>。\\n若是能完成期待度高于3的募集要求的话，\\n便能获得<color=#ff9901>StarHorse4 Edition</color>独有的新道具\\n<color=#ff9901>「星之果实」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f0b447e5d86f2bfd65163392d2e586d6b7ad31669fff670991ef7bfebca56a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d59af8c949c8d93e4b2119a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>签约赛</color>需要以7人组成队伍才可参加。\\n队长由自己拥有的殿堂赛马娘担任，\\n队长以外的六人则可以靠<color=#ff9900>签约</color>来进行替换。\\n不断进行<color=#ff9900>比赛</color>与<color=#ff9900>签约</color>，以成为最强队伍为目标努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32015f1caa8c30e693209b2f60d88eae0d97717c6a17dc25b5099e48b846cd04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433b5f344b70d3da81bff29f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>签约赛入场券</color>会在每日12点恢复至5张。\\n同时，还可以通过完成每日任务或使用道具等手段恢复。\\n<color=#ff9900>赛场环境</color>将<color=#ff9900>每3场比赛替换一次</color>。\\n替换后的赛场环境请于比赛预览界面进行确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4a0cfb785e843ae286fd5246eff92f1a526cd9815270720020ac41f4dea16f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3a7360701285f0fe1c04ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加签约赛之后，能获得<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>。\\n比赛的胜负与对方队伍的等级也会影响<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>的获得量。\\n在各种各样的赛场环境中让队伍的全员都尽可能参赛，\\n以胜利为目标不断努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc23561c5f9a09f0c5baa0b3ab7c10a515731e876fa179638489bae8da9998ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c05c5a34f6b5c2b7fe58b41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>签约时间</color>时，能够与对方队伍的赛马娘进行<color=#ff9900>签约</color>，\\n并且替换自己队伍中的赛马娘。\\n签约所需的<color=#ff9900>签约Pt</color>会随着被签约赛马娘的\\n等级高低而变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78cef1632f858722f35306442f3bbb1bce24554802afa8cd763aa9453a23f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ca3e54cef79bc908506d10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强化队伍后，若是能<color=#ff9900>更新队伍最高等级</color>的话，\\n可以获得相应的报酬。\\n同时，若是完成<color=#ff9900>限定任务</color>的话，也能获得相应的报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e9d77f1966a77ac3bba81eaf5fd6aad34dca5a47ded7fdbed4fc0f4e195d90",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568feee378aae4ec9e4e6c27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "率领队伍＜天狼星＞，\\n与赛马娘们一起推进<color=#ff9900>主线故事</color>吧！\\n推进故事可以获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96e2a1f555cdde647e32c1f10ad56bebe4fe3f35316bf294f43adbc3acd47d89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f2a112322d1348bd084ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在<color=#ff9900>签约赛</color>中获得<color=#ff9900>胜利</color>的话，参赛的队长与\\n队员赛马娘都将会被<color=#ff9900>记载于名册</color>，\\n队伍全员的基础能力与获得签约Pt都会有加成。\\n此外，若是将特定的赛马娘同时编入队伍，\\n并且获得签约赛的胜利的话，便能获得<color=#ff9900>队伍技能</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af7c8dd5fcc96731b13c3ec49b34961da5000e5d0aeb7953ed37a459318c008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d329a9aea089b613e2567c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>活动加速</color>是指，育成开始时通过消耗2倍TP，\\n在育成结束后可获得的<color=#ff9900>考试币</color>将变为2倍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5db8fe0bd9d9cd9cf7a4b950ef42ec9d6f33f750a55717911606b4611499f53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa846c4944824881e3f6f1a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过<color=#ff9900>每日登录散步奖励</color>和<color=#ff9900>游玩各项游戏内容</color>来\\n积攒<color=#ff9900>散步量表</color>。\\n每<color=#ff9900>积攒1支散步量表</color>，便可以同赛马娘一起去<color=#ff9900>散步1次</color>。\\n※每天可积攒2支量表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae5dd236a2f96d9046d16126dfc20dbb61c28c247b6867b466e77a91e01600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5834d49abb79bb147a4de3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以在摄影棚中于<color=#ff9900>训练</color>、<color=#ff9900>外出</color>等各种场合\\n拍摄<color=#ff9900>照片</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21aa81540ac1be3149d9de3c65ac9033fa63d7374e51aef6c1c9bea344d8c17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "153"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec5e53e7644082663ae8c900",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选择想要拍摄照片的赛马娘后，\\n进行<color=#ff9900>季节与外出地点</color>的设置吧。\\n在<color=#ff9900>训练</color>的拍摄中，还可以设置练习伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26a6e1712a290f885247ee02bcabbe17eb4bda3476852d7b5352c078ab96235b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf880ef27e44484e37d973d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拍摄照片时，可以进行<color=#ff9900>画面暂停・循环</color>的操作。\\n找到最好的时机，拍出自己最喜欢的一张照片吧。\\n对拍摄的照片，还可以进行<color=#ff9900>设置滤镜等加工</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ed78ed8d8c51734a8eda4b05b236828a5240874971b96542240b57467244425",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e389fd62970ffa8739b2ebf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行散步之后，作为<color=#ff9900>散步同伴</color>赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>亲密度</color>将会上升。\\n另外，根据所选的散步目的地，还会播放活动限定的\\n<color=#ff9900>散步演出</color>，并可以获得<color=#ff9900>散步奖励</color>。\\n已观看过的演出，可在活动期间内长按赛马娘图标，\\n在「已解锁演出确认」界面重复观看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88c89d303651d8b5c7f29b453b48f67ff5e0de66ec757b86c57da2d73170896",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ac21124343674f43a7726c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在「KIRARI MAGIC SHOW」活动页面，\\n可以查看有关圣诞礼物活动的信息，\\n还可以参与将于12/21举行的TOKYO MEGA ILLUMI联动活动。\\n并且，可以点击<color=#ff9900>每天出现1次的小礼物</color>来获得奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73418f48b2206ce6b9b50b4030911ebb9ba0d08a3d93d816309d0211da3cc67d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b4fa24a452765c9138b41e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "3.5th Anniversary特别活动「UMA Summer」，\\n是一项通过育成来帮助赛马娘们分发中暑击退饮料的活动。\\n在本活动中，根据<color=#ff9900>你分发的中暑击退饮料数量</color>，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动个人奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d93147e140bac5c49f00bb5c9040365dddbb07bb84fdc48eed8aec6b90beec9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2136d8000e6c70131085a249",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练中<color=#ff9900>快乐米可登场！</color>\\n和快乐米可一同切磋琢磨3年，\\n以在URA总决赛中出场为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7010c3eab38bc3607b95a0f3f973e6d1ff3d77346ffeabc6b8f6ef310d5ed521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6cb5cb7bdf17fb0ff0ca544",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与育成赛马娘邂逅，提高<color=#ff9900>亲密度</color>\\n以此推进<color=#ff9900>赛马娘故事</color>吧！\\n亲密度可在育成或团队竞技场中提升。\\n推进故事可以获得报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7546e7c892483a9b80a2d157983b6e16414a24d5ea6833698137da20a88345",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7180ffcf15d4d5e047bfdc29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随机与快乐米可一同训练后，\\n会发生互相比拼基础能力值与体力值的<color=#ff9900>对决事件</color>！\\n对决项目的数值越高越容易获胜，\\n所以通过训练来强化自身后再挑战对决吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9040b7eaf573cb3dfd101cd4184b9d9227131cb39e6bdef1686a196715e0ec9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c0f3dff6269396751c01fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成期间在对决中积累一定次数的胜利后，\\n<color=#ff9900>实力提升的快乐米可</color>将在URA总决赛决赛中登场！\\n和培育的育成赛马娘一起，在决赛的舞台上以获得优胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e619ab4fd84a7fc0144063b0bd3fcc4c0dc304078f43424e7f14b7a9df50ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0058f76eccd384e6b67968f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已爆发青春之魂的队伍成员如果发生青春特训，\\n将会发生仅一次的<color=#ff9900>极・青春之魂爆发</color>！\\n发生后，该队伍成员的<color=#ff9900>基础能力将大幅提升</color>，\\n<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘也将在成长时获得特别技能折扣</color>！\\n在育成中凭借<color=#ff9900>极・青春之魂爆发</color>掀起更大的波澜吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfe34ab434012c75267cd36eb6ccebfd87e68290896f01b2503dc8952a99ea2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dac93e2300b3c11e339b35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果满足了<color=#ff9900>特殊条件</color>的话，青春杯中将会出现<color=#ff9900>豪强队伍</color>！\\n战胜了豪强队伍的话<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘将大幅成长</color>！\\n并且，<color=#ff9900>还可能会在青春杯正式赛时发生些什么</color>……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1ff63c715efe0ca24f70f3dd530898731f231bd382be1298e41e489ce325a4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cb9d36d77aaddb8d54ad37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据<color=#ff9900>大家分发的中暑击退饮料数量</color>，\\n还可获得<color=#ff9900>活动全体奖励</color>。\\n请全体参加活动的训练员们尽可能多地分发中暑击退饮料，\\n让节日的气氛高涨起来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafa6ceb917d2d1e7c76cc0e2aca6f9d0fc36bebc665df8c98f8918d9486f144",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99957a1cad9f2d178d0ce19e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在活动举办期间进行育成，可以赠送写有<color=#ff9900>应援信息</color>的灯笼给小栗帽。应援信息（图片）可以<color=#ff9900>在社交媒体分享</color>。此外，还可以查看其他训练员制作的应援信息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2657c3cb0266f819343c519b0a072b99a6d6799a7a0d9f49b7edd91df43b31d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b891cf802a1beba777544360",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中，需要在3年时间内有效利用三女神的支援，\\n挑战各育成赛马娘的目标！<color=#ff9900>育成目标全部\\n达成的话，将举办特别比赛「Grand Masters」！</color>\\n在与女神们的决斗中取胜，并以获得优胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecf6931d2d8a4b8ba0b0a571776ac0849508e6a6cbe2c359b9ebdfeb6061686",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273893fd5b559bdd1c66062f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成期间，进行训练、休息、外出和比赛时，\\n都可获得来自三女神的<color=#ff9900>知识的碎片</color>！\\n知识的碎片能够自动触发<color=#ff9900>训练所获得基础能力提升</color>等\\n各种有助于育成的效果。\\n<color=#ff9900>进行友情训练的话还可以一次性获得2个！？</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c3bd19dde83fcdfc3d8cf6633236d08ce5d183d4712603505760e45ce1b1b7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be12657c1ee28c42bfb8afd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收集满2个知识的碎片，即可额外获得<color=#ff9900>知识的结晶</color>！\\n知识的结晶也同样是获得后效果自动生效，\\n能够强化训练所获得基础能力。\\n<color=#ff9900>原有知识的碎片的效果仍会继续生效</color>，\\n所以去不断收集来强化赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a62612e1488299b0653ffd0a315e3ee0f9b23da0ac154aec2480cc02f45efc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88181015208c054b7764455",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得的知识的碎片、知识的结晶将被汇总至知识表中。\\n知识表全部积满则将获得<color=#ff9900>女神的睿智</color>！\\n在任意时机习得所获得的女神的睿智，\\n<color=#ff9900>训练等项目将会有1回合限定的强化！</color>\\n每位女神的效果不同，详情请查阅知识表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8f18b3d05c96bce7c019709343674321d46618cd20efc2fdbef2cd4e29391a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3335c04db02b3b0f4cf4db61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用殿堂赛马娘组成<color=#ff9900>队伍</color>，\\n在<color=#ff9900>团队竞技场</color>对战全国的队伍吧。\\n根据团队的活跃程度，提升<color=#ff9900>CLASS</color>，\\n每周，可以获得与所属CLASS相符的报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f56759aa0ddf90924c6061233358e905a2708085cace4b6f9c17ae3864b64b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0036be1af34d605eed0d3ae6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终目标比赛Grand Masters举办前，\\n<color=#ff9900>各级12月后半回合结束后还将举办特别比赛</color>！\\n借助女神之力锻炼育成赛马娘，去挑战各个比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ee4acbee69f8eef7d54354a47849910b6dcdee8a9bbeb293433d0a51e19b3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d31ee94e0e51c27fab119ea9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Grand Masters是仅会举办一次的特别比赛，\\n最强大的竞争对手<color=#ff9900>达利阿拉伯、高多芬阿拉伯、\\n拜耶尔土耳其三女神将全部参赛</color>！\\n和自己培育的赛马娘一起赢得这场对决，以获得优胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "133c134bf388bf01721462c05be9a0046a0225b2a69535cec507e2ad9e5464e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21778ba34f405e53cb3d415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本活动包括<color=#ff9901>主要阶段</color>和<color=#ff9901>特别阶段</color>。\\n主要阶段中，编组<color=#ff9901>3人的队伍</color>来挑战比赛。\\n根据各个赛马娘的名次，可获得<color=#ff9901>联赛得分</color>。\\n根据获得的联赛得分，来提升<color=#ff9901>联赛等级</color>！\\n提升联赛等级可获得各种各样的奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17fb7616f22a1594e17d034c7cd93ba63325c5ef16d5fb52780f15401851ae07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b88b7791fa625a8e7a74dbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>游玩各项游戏内容</color>来积累<color=#ff9900>研究量表</color>。\\n积累量表1个以上后，前往活动首页，\\n可根据积累的数量来获得<color=#ff9900>研究成果奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b50a9578d2495cb0fbbe65c21b611eeb5874f381aa64196725d3bfda92186cb6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:618619d85c199b1b82e81bfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过<color=#ff9900>每日登录盛开奖励</color>、<color=#ff9900>完成育成</color>、<color=#ff9900>参加团队竞技场</color>来\\n积攒<color=#ff9900>盛开量表</color>。量表达到<color=#ff9900>MAX</color>之后，\\n可在活动页面中<color=#ff9900>前进1个格子</color>。\\n※使用每日登录盛开奖励推动前进之后，才能通过\\n育成及团队竞技场来积攒盛开量表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a69231a197fbf3d8d6d54568ce3b6c02b5cb64d2e024c58c0af9c32470c759",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f8b7b89a7dcef065eae8094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次推动前进，都会解锁<color=#ff9900>当地趣闻</color>，\\n获得<color=#ff9900>报酬</color>。\\n4/2及4/3的12:00将解锁<color=#ff9900>新区域</color>，\\n可推动前进到更远的格子。\\n※若没有可推进的格子，则不能积攒盛开量表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "739ec918224f27a32eac84e34449f94ed33b37018319410454f4079a5bbe8ed1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab81e5e3d1e9e531279fd2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "提高育成赛马娘的觉醒Lv所解锁的稀有技能，\\n若能在育成中达成该赛马娘独有条件并完成育成，\\n则此技能可进化为只有该赛马娘才能获得的强有力<color=#ff9900>进化技能</color>。\\n以达成想要的进化技能的获得条件为目标，进行育成吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc1c0c56569b0d1948d775f920c09f5fb64673f00a460c65e878e3e6a174328",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ee9a40c7f9c5ae283399411",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若取得了优异的比赛结果，将记录<color=#ff9900>最高得分</color>。\\n每周，根据最高得分，所属CLASS将发生变动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f04db44296830c837f5a608b794333657e85c3a71c53af48f13a67a02f5f69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddac903395b4e7d4b1fc593a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过消耗<color=#ff9900>技能点数</color>，来获取在可比赛中发动的<color=#ff9900>技能</color>。\\n技能发动的条件有<color=#ff9900>比赛距离</color>或赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>作战策略</color>等\\n各种各样的条件，根据<color=#ff9900>距离适性</color>和<color=#ff9900>脚质适性</color>来获取\\n相符合的技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e6c109517283d6ab5bdb721e74967efdb838bf667eba36d868c979ab0ec56e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0082365d6a5fe84a7c4c75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据<color=#ff9900>支援卡事件</color>或<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘事件</color>的结果，\\n可能会提高技能的<color=#ff9900>折扣Lv</color>。\\n与折扣Lv相应的<color=#ff9900>技能点数消耗将会打折</color>，\\n将拥有你想获得的技能的支援卡加入编组来获取技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f21aff7da34ac44740561de0b93d9dbfcccf3a6ec0c2b6992415a040e03b8bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7152f60a716ea52bfd6e9b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "技能主要有以下3种分类。\\n・<color=#ff9900>固有技能</color>：育成赛马娘在最初便已获得的特殊技能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>稀有技能</color>：可在特殊场合下通过折扣事件获得的强力技能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>普通技能</color>：可在很多场合下通过折扣事件获得的技能。\\n另外，也有仅可通过<color=#ff9900>继承特定的因子</color>才能获取的技能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "272306c7f5e13e1796d045d54a53a97e6efb3146e6649e208ea37d3a367a43fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f4461d2d60b1eead651e9bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "提高育成赛马娘的觉醒Lv所解锁的稀有技能，\\n以及各个育成剧本指定的稀有技能，\\n若能在育成中达成该赛马娘独有条件并完成育成，\\n则上述技能可进化为强有力的<color=#ff9900>进化技能</color>。\\n以达成想要的进化技能的获得条件为目标，进行育成吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "489f66e26117d4120486105a0f9fbefca8129318fffa49d23c6a7b47d709ef41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76fb90faec5c47385441386c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以使用在研究成果奖励中获得的<color=#ff9900>因子研究报告</color>，\\n来提升进入殿堂的赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>因子</color>的<color=#ff9900>★</color>。\\n※仅部分因子可使用因子研究报告。\\n※因子研究报告不可在下次活动中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73651a933c8b3630d749a2663c3708519db08e4b6b2d1a55cd8890fb278ae781",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4310a53ee2b9a2d91b794e67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>活动加速</color>是指，育成开始时通过消耗2倍TP，\\n在育成结束后可获得的<color=#ff9900>研究量表上升率</color>将变为2倍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b5d0c8fbd9645ff16f9ca73cced52275161b50cde16b87901e02ae939d84e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cb2162423131da8348d9a4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各区域的最终格子为<color=#ff9900>目标地点</color>，\\n到达后可观看<color=#ff9900>特别视频</color>。\\n视频会于4/1～4/3的19:00、4/4的12:00公开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6a7084f49dec09e6e19a723714a065d24791244ab2a4e3a90935f4aaffd534",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9567dff8a04eb1bc3161bc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接受马赞期间，每1场比赛可以给1个人的赛马娘\\n<color=#ff9900>点「马赞！」来应援</color>！\\n点「马赞！」后可获得<color=#ff9900>马赞奖励</color>。\\n马赞奖励可在A-B集团中各获得1次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9cc2125398d86eb3b6d9ed0ef253670985e01b2232412ff70f18f55231e62c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6549655728e9dfc4ed230751",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特别阶段的比赛正在举行！\\nA-B集团各自的主要比赛以及\\n自己队伍参加的比赛将被播放。\\n观看主要比赛后可获得奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b119148e6e7d0da0a453fd3155b009e5f0820ad1fc44fe39cc9e0d906482e1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af8f62f0d53b9ff86f55c1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "社团可以制作<color=#ff9901>独特的名片</color>，\\n并将名片(图片)<color=#ff9901>分享至SNS</color>。\\n名片上除社团信息外，还会显示自定义图像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5d34d690cc49e5499ba548a307b982671e0d280c7f7fdad82b86cb59f2e8155",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6894b444b1420e38eeb83eed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "团队竞技场中，每次将进行<color=#ff9900>5场不同条件的比赛</color>。\\nCLASS提高的话1场比赛中可参赛的人数也会增加，\\n最高可派出15名赛马娘参赛。\\n组成最强的队伍，挑战团队竞技场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f4975e19f68a7ffc20e6ff944bc4bb41527cdd362d57a2453aef6a90a50957",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa956dee86639f2bf5ab518d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>联赛入场券</color>可于每天12时获得<color=#ff9900>5张</color>。\\n1张联赛入场券用于参加<color=#ff9900>5场比赛</color>。\\n每1场比赛都与不同队伍对战，共计5支队伍。\\n每5场比赛的天气和马场状态为随机设定，\\n其他比赛环境是预先确定的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a14523f705a7703e50f9d71ae6383ed260e5d590d6541fab18206c31e8cb805",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c4c951fbd1c800113a1e7b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加比赛会积累<color=#ff9900>英雄量表</color>，\\n达到MAX后可获得<color=#ff9900>5场比赛限定</color>的<color=#ff9900>英雄技能</color>！\\n英雄技能中，有技能需要通过使用比赛专用道具以满足生效条件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa2faf17144963577314ef3a241de8c231e04a9a0615f7d4a4c910c89b37036",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d5ca1f87726791407aeb2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "联赛等级从<color=#ff9900>BRONZE1～PLATINUM4</color>共有16个等级。\\n达到PLATINUM1的话，可获得含有在英雄联赛中活跃的\\n赛马娘的名字的<color=#ff9900>活动限定称号</color>！\\n可从达到条件的赛马娘中进行选择。\\n与各种各样的队伍对战，以PLATINUM为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec62b26eae5f585d3bcb989b1adc45127803d77860bfe7637b793d6f7c14ad3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0563f72a2e64c2d9011b08f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得联赛联赛得分排名<color=#ff9900>TOP96</color>的队伍\\n将参加特别阶段的比赛！\\nA-B集团将分别举办12场比赛，<color=#ff9900>共24场比赛</color>。\\n参加比赛的赛马娘可以获得称号<color=#ff9900>[SUPER HERO]</color>！\\n※可在选项中选择是否参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b28975b31ebe76ff46c07e46139468d5c76990dbf1c499a4e85ce6a3b39e555",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b4f50d79da6d0efc232a7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特别阶段的接受马赞期间，\\n每1场比赛可以给1个人的赛马娘<color=#ff9900>点「马赞！」</color>来应援。\\n点「马赞！」后可获得马赞奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf7fc7fc2f1c2cb1973eaec4c3b93cc92d7934e88ed001b79f42e8285530fca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:769e7e9e34a526184558b489",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "A-B集团各自的<color=#ff9900>第11场比赛</color>为<color=#ff9900>主要比赛</color>。\\nA集团的主要比赛由排名1～4位的队伍参加，B集团的\\n主要比赛由排名5～8位的队伍参加。\\n观看主要比赛后可获得奖励。\\n全部24场比赛可从想看的赛马娘的视角来观看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "546907d729369b755c887ae6e4aa1389cb8683e28ab3cca945baf48d3a3cef86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:012ce9bf0f411890ce9162f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在特别移籍中，将殿堂赛马娘<color=#ff9901>移籍到其他队伍\\n可获得奖励</color>。\\n另外请注意，送至其他队伍的殿堂赛马娘将会消失，\\n且无法恢复。\\n招募将于<color=#ff9901>每周一 5:00</color>更新。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3dfd5571a16457335d9ee66744a249f92154c5fba07e6aa10d986a8f4a6890",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2615296219e2a72ffd93da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据移籍目标队伍所希望的条件不同，<color=#ff9901>奖励的内容也会改变。</color>\\n另外，各招募都有期待度，<color=#ff9901>对方期待度越高，\\n送出殿堂赛马娘后可获得的奖励就越豪华</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8335fbd67c1fb95f4e87b8f0c71ab610e7a40e1b01a3aff3bde5dd178a44429",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c664054b582b480904bccc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在期待度高的招募中，\\n可获得移籍赛马娘的<color=#ff9901>赛马娘碎片</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a8e2d14e67d307ea2ff19f54f7d1d5a6b38143584fd08c210e10b6acb922d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e8f1ccd889fecabd3ded45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "社团名片只能由<color=#ff9901>社团部长</color>进行编辑。\\n请社团部长试着通过自定义社团信息、说明\\n和图像来宣传社团活动吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf2066be498be07c4abd0b04071a4e226d60fa743bced23a4f555fdb46aa004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d266f3b0d6dcc23fa20f9afc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与赛马娘一同度过为期3年的<color=#ff9900>闪耀系列赛</color>，\\n帮助她们<color=#ff9900>实现梦想吧</color>！\\n赛马娘们的目标各不相同。\\n指导各个赛马娘，以知名训练员为目标而努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "953f7ae5051a791ca7744e2a3a01ddd099ed70b32c652ae499af791688336eb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ba2ab8034ba5e17522e1ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "编组<color=#ff9900>殿堂赛马娘</color>们，将她们组成<color=#ff9900>队伍</color>吧。\\n在5种不同条件的比赛中，\\n选择拥有适性的殿堂赛马娘吧。\\n设为<color=#ff9900>エース（领队）</color>的赛马娘获得的分数为<color=#ff9900>1.1倍</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d8eeba686a7a00dad131e81cbd25309b38cf6287959cab30009b78f7d2379c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e23da56c038068afa3db109",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以随时挑战可在育成中游玩的抓娃娃游戏。\\n瞄准目标抓取<color=#ff9900>赛马娘布娃娃（嘚嘚玩偶）</color>吧！\\n已获得的布娃娃可在<color=#ff9900>收藏品</color>中确认。\\n去获得大量布娃娃，<color=#ff9900>来增加收藏品吧！</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f3a2ae026dc364c4c3e3a614804f5a8c9db643bdda74b5be40fb9346835f210",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374d635782d3c6ab29b76252",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中育成赛马娘没有各自的目标，\\n<color=#ff9900>制霸凯旋门赏</color>将成为共同目标！\\n挑战凯旋门赏的机会在<color=#ff9900>经典级和古马级共有2次</color>。\\n在一起追逐梦想的L'Arc计划中，与成员\\n互相切磋琢磨，以制霸凯旋门赏为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c55748769f4fff3f1db825f3afa15aed39b3e79c634300048c3fede771faf09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb1a314a8f48bf94da8eefb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在重赏比赛中进入前5名，与L'Arc成员进行SS竞赛，\\n会提高<color=#ff9900>支援者Pt</color>及提升<color=#ff9900>粉丝期待度</color>。\\n粉丝期待度上升后，将会有训练效果上升、\\n数值获得、训练Lv提高等\\n与赛马娘成长相关联的效果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddfdb36319219d290473face3d516fbb2300daf64bef8f61305c4968e02b2ee1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322e302fb0fddb52b497042e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了让赛马娘在海外竞马场发挥出已有的能力，\\n<color=#ff9900>获得海外适性</color>以及<color=#ff9900>强化</color>是必不可少的。\\n通过达成条件来获得海外适性，通过升级来\\n<color=#ff9900>克服海外比赛课题</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6c3c2347f95f3dc2e91685c55c74840aedef65a506add69af43a473b08a6d0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba778ea791e6f47b91c7e69",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>与海外赛马娘的交流战</color>在育成中共会举办4次。\\n这是在VR空间中的隆尚竞马场举办的，\\n同海外比赛一样<color=#ff9900>会发生课题的比赛</color>。\\n参赛同样能获得支援者Pt和适性Pt，\\n<color=#ff9900>提高海外适性</color>，以获胜为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b664bd47e47b9311d6a31869a516ed4ef0d9ee265ecdd8b2b22ce32f07c90906",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab30b46a77b2e41d27ba74c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "满足SS竞赛或比赛获胜等各种条件后，\\n能够<color=#ff9900>获得海外适性</color>！\\n<color=#ff9900>适性不同、获得条件也不同</color>，确认好条件，\\n以获得更多海外适性为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d015f73c8673ac2365a19d6bb81e2436b56c27ae837ed041eed86ddcd4573a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2989879144f1ef7cc585bc10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用可从SS竞赛和海外远征中获得的<color=#ff9900>适性Pt</color>，\\n可以使<color=#ff9900>海外适性升级</color>！\\n适性Lv上升后，除了能克服课题外，还能发挥\\n适性及加成等育成中有利的效果。\\n积累适性Pt，积极地去升级吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5daa97ce5b41db894164f3fcfe3955a841dffc9eb9785464c9b2bb6df369125",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a931096eb7a85b8080ff859b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "L'Arc成员会在训练及比赛中积累<color=#ff9900>明星量表</color>，\\n<color=#ff9900>积满后可以进行SS竞赛</color>！\\n进行SS竞赛需要消耗１回合，但<color=#ff9900>最多可与5人</color>\\n同时进行，并会使支援者Pt和数值上升！\\n有时，还会发生比SS竞赛更强的<color=#ff9900>SSS竞赛</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba779c253b9254f1f26f655a1a4500b93c0949a77da82a37d96ee8ffb7f97852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ea0cf777f16ab04a428e80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与L'Arc成员进行SS竞赛获胜后，\\n每个成员都会<color=#ff9900>获得胜利加成</color>。\\n将会获得技能折扣及状态等各种各样的奖励，\\n成员聚集时，积极地去挑战SS竞赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec24ad0f9a2badcbf0d006affcf1685cbe2212c4c0d995a16f45273922f97e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb993f7a284014907d9618e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "7月前半至10月前半的<color=#ff9900>海外远征</color>，\\n可以在法国进行<color=#ff9900>特别训练</color>。\\n在海外能<color=#ff9900>获得大量适性Pt</color>，\\n因此这是个一口气提升海外适性等级的好机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da22809ce7a0318bf665f435b8d4f3028e171332a0a9ff8e80e207fceca4e29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8ffd594ec2bb8f39e83cf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "编入强大的殿堂赛马娘后，\\n<color=#ff9900>队伍评价</color>将会提高，<color=#ff9900>队伍等级</color>也会上升。\\n队伍等级上升后也能得到报酬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7b2f2ef170aafbf863b58c2fb859e17cc17263b17125f48acffa5989a4869b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95851e77dc84504457d083b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海外远征期间，需在经典级9月前半参加<color=#ff9900>尼尔赏</color>，\\n在古马级9月前半参加<color=#ff9900>富瓦赏</color>。\\n在前哨战中得到锻炼，再去挑战10月前半的<color=#ff9900>凯旋门赏</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a037dc9fa63effc68a36375d0971462273d761c35fa2be1153b4de414464ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5bf81e5138544542512665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "签约赛经过10战后，会发生<color=#ff9900>每天1次</color>的<color=#ff9900>特别赛</color>。\\n特别赛无需消耗签约赛入场券即可参赛，需与NPC的特别队伍对战。\\n此外，获胜后可获得更多的签约Pt。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d341850230586ca55d81090438207893adbceb3e3f4abff75633e67ad647a460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "211"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
